            <h2>Why Hodge Podge?</h2>
            <p>Daily Hodge Podge is a raw mix of everything that fuels real living, everyday grind of fixing, building, and creating. A true hodge podge of passions, chaos, music, grit, spontaneous thriving and out of the box thinking. Where nothing is boxed in and everything just works.</p>
            <p>Often shortened to DailyHP, it also stands for Daily Health Points, a reminder that every ride, adventure, creative pursuit, and little accomplishment adds points to the experience of living.</p>
            <p>The merch follows the same rule: no fluff, just gear that looks sharp and gets worn every day.</p>
            
            <p class="muted"> The crest brings the letters D, H and P together inside a circle, cut through by a bold diagonal. It reads as a badge, a stamp and a signature all at once.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="story-photo reveal">
            <img src="images/rider.jpg" alt="Daily Hodge Podge rider on the trail" />
        </div>
