        <div class="pillar reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Limited Runs</h3><p>Drops come in small batches. When they're gone, they're gone.</p></div>
        <div class="pillar reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Community First</h3><p>Made with the people who show up every day. That's you.</p></div>
